---
source: crates/pgt-ddl/src/build/pgtype.rs
expression: render(&pl)
---
[Safe] ALTER TYPE public.ty RENAME TO ty2
[Safe] ALTER TYPE public.ty2 SET SCHEMA app
[Safe] ALTER TYPE app.ty2 RENAME ATTRIBUTE a TO a2
[Safe] ALTER TYPE app.ty2 RENAME ATTRIBUTE d TO e
[DataLoss] ALTER TYPE app.ty2 DROP ATTRIBUTE b  -- tipi kullanan tablolardaki veri kaybolur
[DataLoss] ALTER TYPE app.ty2 ALTER ATTRIBUTE a2 TYPE bigint  -- tipi kullanan tablolardaki veri kaybolur
[Safe] ALTER TYPE app.ty2 ADD ATTRIBUTE b text
[Safe] ALTER TYPE app.ty2 ADD ATTRIBUTE f uuid
[Safe] COMMENT ON TYPE app.ty2 IS 'k'
[Safe] ALTER TYPE app.ty2 OWNER TO r
